WEBVTT

00:12:59.375 --> 00:13:01.434
and how to make their voice heard

00:13:01.458 --> 00:13:02.851
on the world stage.

00:13:02.875 --> 00:13:05.226
So as globalization ends

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:08.643
and chaos seems to reign,

00:13:08.667 --> 00:13:11.601
these countries, their young populations

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:15.434
and the scope they have
to build new societies

00:13:15.458 --> 00:13:17.101
are the future

00:13:17.125 --> 00:13:19.333
and the promise of the new world order.

00:13:20.333 --> 00:13:21.583
Thank you.